[47.02370285987854,"o","\rNotes for main/imagemagick:"]
[47.023762941360474,"o","\r\n  ImageMagick requires Ghostscript to handle PDF files properly.\u001b[56C"]
[47.02383875846863,"o","\r\n  You can install it by: scoop install ghostscript\u001b[70C"]
[47.023919343948364,"o","\r\n\u001b[120C"]
[47.02400207519531,"o","\r\n  'convert.exe' is deprecated in v7 (it also conflicts with the builtin Windows 'convert' utility).\u001b[21C"]
[47.02406287193298,"o","\r\n  Use 'magick convert ...' instead.\u001b[85C"]
[47.03292465209961,"o","\r\n\u001b[120C"]
[53.148025035858154,"o","\r\n\u001b[120C"]
[53.14810657501221,"o","\rNotes for main/bun:"]
[53.14820671081543,"o","\r\n  For the last release built on the original Zig codebase, use `versions/bun1.3`.\u001b[39C"]
